## Determinism Verification

### Cache Key Components
1. rustc version (exact match required)
2. RUSTFLAGS (exact match required)
3. Target triple (exact match required)
4. Cargo.toml dependencies (hash match required)
5. Source code (hash match required)

### Non-Deterministic Factors (excluded from cache keys)
- Build timestamps
- Absolute paths
- User/hostname
- CPU features (unless explicitly set in RUSTFLAGS)

### Recommended CI Environment
```bash
export CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0
export RUSTFLAGS="-C target-cpu=x86-64"
export CARGO_BUILD_TARGET="x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu"
```

